"The Rammas gate is under attack."
End

SCRIPT:Hint_Rammas_Gate_Damaged
"The Rammas gate is almost destroyed."
End

SCRIPT:Hint_Rammas_Retreat
"The Rammas is lost, fall back."
End

////////////CINE BOROMIR///////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_faramir090
"Faramir: The Rammas is breached! The Shadow is almost upon us."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_boromir108
"Boromir: We cannot allow the White City to fall."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf320
"Gandalf: Take heart! Our hopes now lie in the strength of Men.\nSauron underestimates you. This he will come to regret!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf321
"Gandalf: Man the battlements! Prepare for battle!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf419
""
END

