"Fountain Guards have joined your forces to defend Minas Tirith"
END

////////////OUTER///////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf430
"Take command of the trebuchets! Their flaming shot will burn their ranks before they reach our walls!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf333
"Harken to me! We must destroy those siege ladders!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf334
"Our aim must be true if we are to repel these towers!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf335
"They are destroying our trebuchets! Stop them!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf336
"We must rebuild our trebuchets!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf337
"Lord Forlong is surrounded!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf338
"Lord Hirluin needs our assistance!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf339
"They will overwhelm Lord Golasgil! Rally to his aid!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf340
"Send aid to Lord Duinhir!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf341
"We must protect Lord Devorin!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf342
"Faramir, do not throw away your life so rashly!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf343
"Boromir! Go, aid your Captain!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf344
"Peregrin Took! This is no place for a hobbit! Fall back to safety."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf345
"Irolas! I am coming!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf346
"Beregond is being overwhelmed!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf347
"Our walls are overrun! We must push them back!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf348
"Our defences weaken! Fight or they will overrun us!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf349
"Trolls! Archers, to the gate!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf350
"Battering rams approach! Defend the gate!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf351
"Fell Olog-hai! Faramir rally your archers to the gate!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf352
"Fell Olog-hai! Beregond rally your archers to the gate!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf353
"Nazgul! Steel yourselves, archers! Bring them down!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf354
"Cast out your fear! Aim for their Fell beasts!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf355
"Drive them from the walls!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf356
"Stand firm! The strength of men must not wither!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf357
"Your valor will turn the tide—fight on!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf358
"Here we must break Sauron's armies!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf359
"Take heart men!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf360
"With me men of Gondor! We must rally to the gate!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf375
"These orcs are stronger than the others! Their blades are imbued with a fell incantation! Stand fast!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf376
"Elite orcs approach! Stop them here!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf407
"Variags from Khand! They must be repelled!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf408
"The Variags are charging! Stop them at the wall!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf409
"Easterlings! Show them no mercy!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf410
"Wicked Men from the East! Cast them out!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf411
"Those Uruks are dangerous! Destroy them, ere we are overrun!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf412
