END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf362
"Wicked Men from the East! This will be their end!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf363
"Steady! We will hold them here, until the women and children are safe!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf364
"Warg riders! Ready yourselves!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf413
