////////////RETREAT///////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf366
"We cannot tarry! We must reach the second level with all haste!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf373
"We must save them, before they're cut down!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf374
"Your courage will not be forgotten, friend. May the Valar protect you."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gondorsoldier032
"Mithrandir! Over here! We're hard-pressed!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gondorsoldier033
"You have our thanks, Mithrandir. We must make haste to the upper levels before it is too late."
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_masteratarms018
"Go on. I will stay behind, to save all those that I can."
End

////////////INNER///////////////

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf367
"Sauron underestimates the valour of Gondor. We will make them fight for every stone! Hold! Hold! Or soon our dead will lie upon each of the Seven Levels of Minas Tirith. We must fight! For Gondor!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf368
"The gate has fallen! Draw your swords, we must stop them here!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf369
"Kill that troll before he destroys the inner gate!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf370
"Stop that ram! Before it reaches the inner gate!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf371
"The inner gate is damaged! Send for timbers!"
END

SCRIPT:mgfotr_gandalf372
"The gate has fallen! We can no longer hold them here. Fall back men!"
END

